  "description": "After a long period of training, Gu Hwa-Woon finally decides to leave Shaolin Temple to learn more. He prepares all the necessary items for the long journey and sets out on his adventure, but as expected, he encounters difficult situations. In preparation for such situations, Hwa-Woon tries to deal with them using the potions he prepared, but... Oh no, it's not a normal body strengthening potion... What, an aphrodisiac?!? In a fit of confusion, he uses his maximized body(!) in a way that isn't martial arts to fiercely subdue his opponent... But Gu Hwa-Woon leaves in search of a new opponent, leaving behind an uneasy feeling. What will his future journey hold?\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
